Magoito<\/strong> e percorrem as fal\u00e9sias atl\u00e2nticas entre as praias de <strong>Giribeto<\/strong>, <strong>Magoito<\/strong>, <strong>Aguda<\/strong> e <strong>Samarra<\/strong>, integrando tro\u00e7os da <strong>Grande Rota do Atl\u00e2ntico (GR11-E9)<\/strong> rumo \u00e0s Azenhas do Mar, antes de infletirem para o interior rural pelos pomares de ma\u00e7\u00e3 reineta de <strong>Fontanelas<\/strong>, o bosque e a cascata da ribeira de Magoito e uma descida t\u00e9cnica em duna de areia. O programa contempla o <strong>Trail Sprint 19 km<\/strong> (19,2 km com 600 m D+, Grau 2 ATRP, partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>), o <strong>Trail 13 km<\/strong> (13,3 km com 470 m D+, Grau 2 ATRP, partida \u00e0s <strong>09:20<\/strong>) e duas <strong>Caminhadas de 12 km e 8 km<\/strong> (12,5 km e 8,2 km, partida conjunta \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong>).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Mag8 Nature Events<\/strong>, seguindo as normas t\u00e9cnicas e de sustentabilidade da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail Running de Portugal (ATRP), com cronometragem por chip, seguro desportivo e cerim\u00f3nia de p\u00f3dio entre as <strong>12:00 e as 13:30<\/strong> junto ao Bar da Praia. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">30 de Maio de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Praia do Magoito, Sintra, Lisboa<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/stron