13,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/02 a 20\/05\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 8 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 30 de Maio de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 11,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/02 a 20\/05\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Eco Trail Praia Mag8 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Eco Trail Praia Mag8 realiza-se no domingo, 30 de maio de 2027, na Praia do Magoito (Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o das Lampas e Terrugem, concelho de Sintra). As partidas s\u00e3o faseadas junto ao Bar da Praia: Trail Sprint 19 km \u00e0s 09:00, Trail 13 km \u00e0s 09:20 e Caminhadas de 12 km e 8 km \u00e0s 09:30. Consulta mais provas na regi\u00e3o no calend\u00e1rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sintra\/\">corridas em Sintra<\/a>.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e limite de vagas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em duas fases at\u00e9 20 de maio de 2027 (limitadas a 380 vagas nos Trails e 120 vagas nas Caminhadas): at\u00e9 15\/02\/2027 custam 16,00 \u20ac (Trail 19 km), 14,00 \u20ac (Trail 13 km), 12,00 \u20ac (Caminhada 12 km) e 11,00 \u20ac (Caminhada 8 km); de 16\/02 a 20\/05\/2027 passam para 18,00 \u20ac, 16,00 \u20ac, 13,00 \u20ac e 12,00 \u20ac, respetivamente. As provas de Trail incluem oferta de gola (buff) alusiva, sendo poss\u00edvel adquirir t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (+3,50 \u20ac) e menu refei\u00e7\u00e3o (+5,00 \u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a altimetria, o tempo limite e onde ficam os abastecimentos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Sprint 19 km (19,2 km reales) acumula 600 m D+ com tempo limite de 3h30m, enquanto o Trail 13 km (13,3 km reais) soma 470 m D+ com tempo limite de 2h30m (ambos Grau 2 ATRP). Existem postos de abastecimento no Km 5 (Quinta da Moita Velha - \u00e1gua), Km 8 (Praia do Magoito - l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos) e Km 13,5 (Rua do Tojalinho em Fontanelas - exclusivo 19 km). Planeia o teu esfor\u00e7o na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">calculadora de pace<\/a>.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio e onde funciona o secretariado?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Por raz\u00f5es ambientais no Parque Natural de Sintra-Cascais, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece copos nem garrafas descart\u00e1veis nos abastecimentos, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio levar reservat\u00f3rio de l\u00edquidos ou copo reutiliz\u00e1vel. O secretariado para levantamento de dorsais funciona no dia da prova (30 de maio) entre as 07:30 e as 09:30 no Bar da Praia do Magoito. V\u00ea tamb\u00e9m o nosso guia sobre <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/como-escolher-sapatilhas-trail\/\">como escolher sapatilhas de trail<\/a>.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Eco Trail Praia Mag8 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Mag8 Nature Events (mag8ne@gmail.com | Tel. 917 817 101), com estacionamento gratuito nos parques de acesso \u00e0 Praia do Magoito (recomendando-se o acesso pela estrada principal de Magoito e evitando caminhos rurais por Fontanelas). Descobre mais desafios no <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\">calend\u00e1rio de trail running<\/a>.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Eco Trail Praia Mag8 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-05-30\", \"endDate\": \"2027-05-30\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Praia do Magoito, Sintra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sintra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Eco Trail Praia Mag8 2027 realiza-se a 30 de maio na Praia do Magoito, Sintra. Provas de Trail 19 km e 13 km e Caminhadas de 12 km e 8 km. Inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-praia-mag8.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TPM19k - Trail Sprint 19 km\", \"price\": \"16.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/s